e6_spawn-log_-reviewer--reviewer--claude-_RUN-260918-fdce92.log\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260830-2g5be6/TASK-260830-2g5be6_spawn-log_-reviewer--reviewer--claude-_RUN-260918-fdce92.log\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"System spawn log captured by task-board\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-2g5be6_review-verdict-rev2.md\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260830-2g5be6/TASK-260830-2g5be6_review-verdict-rev2.md\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Independent review verdict for CR rev2: CHANGES REQUESTED (P2 evidence contract: claimed 17/17 member-level ratio measured 15/17 — row 8 sealed unstable pre/post digests unpinned, row 10 seal-before-gate at CaptureAndProject unpinned; P3: unplanned special member, symlinked store root, excluded-member size claim, branch-bound attribution). All five rev1 survivors KILLED 2/2; production correct on every probe.\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-2g5be6_review-evidence-rev2.tar.gz\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260830-2g5be6/TASK-260830-2g5be6_review-evidence-rev2.tar.gz\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Reviewer rev2 evidence: 36 probe lines, reviewer battery 20 rows x 2 runs with per-plant raw logs and subprocess exits (5 rev1 re-plants KILLED, 5 new SURVIVED executed under mutant), producer harness reproduced 35/35 x2, crash injection at AfterWalk x2, hygiene/neighbour/whole-repo logs, MANIFEST.sha256 (137 rows).\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-2g5be6_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260918-0cd4a1.log\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260830-2g5be6/TASK-260830-2g5be6_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260918-0cd4a1.log\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"System spawn log captured by task-board\\\"}],\\\"parent\\\":\\\"STORY-260830-1cyj0q\\\",\\\"preconditionResources\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-2g5be6_producer.md\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260830-2g5be6/TASK-260830-2g5be6_producer.md\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-2g5be6_rework-rev3.md\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260830-2g5be6/TASK-260830-2g5be6_rework-rev