t restored by hand — and a stray `zz_debug_test.go` scratch probe was removed; candidate code unchanged; the full 27-command suite, package suite, P3-b probe, and mutant battery were re-executed on the new base with fresh logs.\\n- BOUNDS (sibling scope, not waived): per-kind event payload fact registries past the envelope (which facts a kind may carry; the §1.6 value model on every payload member is enforced here); `maximal_safe` planning past the refusal gate; G2 admission past `RefuseUnstableForTarget`; Section 7.8 operation wiring (stays `sessadapter`). Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree.\\n- AC: 18 of 18 rows driven through production entries by named tests (matrix in `TASK-260830-24z2b3_conformance-matrix.md`).\\n\\n### TASK-260917-10k118: reconstructed the reviewed v0.7.0 adoption on trunk 7efe385 (STORY-260916-3uqbwq unlandable, accepted CRs frozen)\\n- METHOD: true pin delta is `git diff e4e3e88 9cb5dd4` (10 files) — the exported 238-file patch diffs unrelated tips and would revert five landed stories, so it was used as transport only; rev3 candidate bytes applied (15 modified + 3 new) with the 5 trunk-merged files copied verbatim after diff-review (no trunk test lost, `task-board.config.json` untouched). All 19 machine-applied files `cmp`-identical to the rev3 bytes; ownership sha256 `2548870d…8a5070`, projection digest `c4cd46bf…53473f6` recomputed two independent ways.\\n- RE-VERIFIED (this session, fresh clone + production helpers): tag `d4abe46f…795b3` Good, peeled `32b3f2ba…321834`, SPEC blob `c4903e60…1ddd86` 1185291 bytes sha256 `c6b2fe64…89ddcf` byte-identical to `SPEC.v0.7.0.md`; lock 64/64 rows order- and set-identical to the §1.5 table (1 known order normalization); 65/65 bindings + 132/132 cases carried with 3 reviewed additions each; all 49 discharged clauses re-measured (uniform +20/+79/+185/+281/+392, excerpts verbatim); rev3 prose says \\\"48 carried clause lines\\\" in two places — measured 49, matching the 49/569 numerator; artif