{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d7c9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b2d0-7ac7-7f03-8c97-ccb0ee9decb3"},"sequence":2623,"recorded_at":1780531400005241,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"6c09b2f8-d07d-42a7-92aa-11c55130fea2","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"6c09b2f8-d07d-42a7-92aa-11c55130fea2","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"6c09b2f8-d07d-42a7-92aa-11c55130fea2"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — revision 3 handed off (`to-review`, checklist 19/19).\n\nClosed both unmeasured AC rows from the rev2 verdict: row 8 now asserts the sealed unstable pre/post digests and generation against the measurements (killed by `N-unstable-seals-pre-as-post`), and row 10 scans the capture store for sealed manifests at `CaptureAndProject` (killed by the new `N-race-order-project-seal`; the old ordering row is killed by the seal error message, now stated honestly). Added the P3-a unplanned-symlink, P3-b symlinked-store-root, and P3-c excluded-size rows (shipped, not reworded), attributed the branch bound to the landed `DecodeWorkspaceBinding` with a first-hand survival probe, and shipped all four P3-e harness rows. Measured ratio: 17 of 17, with a per-row killer table in the results.\n\nEvidence: 27-command suite green (39/39 packages, race-clean, clonesnap 87.5%), 44/44 mutant battery twice with per-plant logs, real gzip archive with verified manifest. Candidate left uncommitted on the Story branch; no production logic changed.","reason":null}}
